[[63,7,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584248\">1056B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584360\">1056B87</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584351\">1036G48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584899\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584902\">5510D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584375\">1092B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584377\">1092B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584159\">1008B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584157\">1008A46</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584193\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584195\">1032B40</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the upper rear timing gear cover\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021133.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the lower rear timing gear cover\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021134.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refi